### Crear pokemon (debe dar 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/pokemon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ivysaur",
  "height": 10,
  "weight": 130,
  "base_experience": 142,
  "types": ["grass", "poison"],
  "abilities": [
    { "name": "overgrow" },
    { "name": "chlorophyll", "is_hidden": true }
  ],
  "stats": [
    { "name": "hp", "base_value": 60 },
    { "name": "attack", "base_value": 62 },
    { "name": "defense", "base_value": 63 },
    { "name": "special-attack", "base_value": 80 },
    { "name": "special-defense", "base_value": 80 },
    { "name": "speed", "base_value": 60 }
  ]
}

### Altura negativa (debe dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/pokemon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testmon",
  "height": -5,
  "weight": 10,
  "types": ["grass"]
}

### Tipo que no existe (debe dar 400 y no dejar nada guardado)
POST http://localhost:3000/pokemon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testmon",
  "height": 5,
  "weight": 10,
  "types": ["grass", "noexiste"]
}

### Body incompleto (debe dar 400 en formato JSON)
POST http://localhost:3000/pokemon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testmon"
}

### Listar pokemon (sin testmon)
GET http://localhost:3000/pokemon

### Ver ivysaur por nombre
GET http://localhost:3000/pokemon/name/ivysaur

### Listar tipos
GET http://localhost:3000/types

### Pokemon de tipo grass (id 2)
GET http://localhost:3000/types/2/pokemon